{"data": [{"author_id": "1992632057936408576", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:30:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119180735269548087"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 230, "start": 217, "tag": "Mitochondria"}], "urls": [{"description": "DddA-derived cytosine base editors (DdCBE) introduce pathogenic heteroplasmic variants of MT-ND1 or MT-ND5 into Neurogenin 2 (NGN2)-inducible human iPSCs", "display_url": "mito.news/articles/10-64…", "end": 255, "expanded_url": "https://mito.news/articles/10-64898-2026-10-28-762518", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119120438974431232/V8yV9Vvb?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119120438974431232/V8yV9Vvb?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 232, "status": 200, "title": "Complex I heteroplasmy in MT-ND1 or MT-ND5 is enough to drop neuronal membrane potential and stall commitment", "unwound_url": "https://mito.news/articles/10-64898-2026-10-28-762518", "url": "https://t.co/dXVBDHkN7w"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/4jaQMaO0Hd", "end": 279, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Mitochondria411/status/2119180735269548087/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119180731398098944", "start": 256, "url": "https://t.co/4jaQMaO0Hd"}]}, "id": "2119180735269548087", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Base editing of mitochondrial ND1 or ND5 in human stem cells holds Complex I heteroplasmy into neurons. The variants barely change stem-cell metabolism, yet they drop membrane potential and blunt neuronal commitment.\n#Mitochondria\n\nhttps://t.co/dXVBDHkN7w https://t.co/4jaQMaO0Hd", "url": "https://x.com/Mitochondria411/status/2119180735269548087"}, {"author_id": "2111357007848681472", "created_at": "2026-11-07T22:00:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119188247331082461"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 155, "start": 131, "tag": "AntimicrobialResistance"}, {"end": 163, "start": 156, "tag": "CRISPR"}, {"end": 175, "start": 164, "tag": "CrisprBits"}], "urls": [{"description": "CrisprBits' PathCrisp uses CRISPR to spot drug-resistant infections in about two hours, at a fraction of sequencing costs. Inside the Bengaluru biotech.", "display_url": "exceptional.technology/crisprbits-pat…", "end": 129, "expanded_url": "https://exceptional.technology/crisprbits-pathcrisp-crispr-diagnostics-bengaluru/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119188256546058240/kWFjcHk_?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119188256546058240/kWFjcHk_?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 106, "status": 200, "title": "CrisprBits PathCrisp: CRISPR Diagnostics, Bengaluru", "unwound_url": "https://exceptional.technology/crisprbits-pathcrisp-crispr-diagnostics-bengaluru/", "url": "https://t.co/92UJJv4G7C"}]}, "id": "2119188247331082461", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Answer in Two Hours: Inside CrisprBits, the Bengaluru Startup Turning CRISPR Into Faster Diagnostics\n\nhttps://t.co/92UJJv4G7C\n\n#AntimicrobialResistance #CRISPR #CrisprBits", "url": "https://x.com/excep_tech/status/2119188247331082461"}, {"author_id": "818008252814217217", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:11:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119175810456416679"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 179, "start": 172, "tag": "CRISPR"}], "urls": [{"description": "昨日（2026年11月7日）、「アロステリックヘアピンDNAプローブ」という巧妙な仕掛けを発想・実装することで、DNAを標的とするCas12aによるRNAの直接検出を実現した研究を紹介しました [crisp_bio 2026-11-07]。これに対して本日は、RNAも直接標的とするCas12バリアントの機構", "display_url": "crisp-bio.blog.jp/archives/40953…", "end": 111, "expanded_url": "https://crisp-bio.blog.jp/archives/40953896.html", "images": [{"height": 273, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119175857063550976/8rYHmvIJ?format=png&name=orig", "width": 240}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119175857063550976/8rYHmvIJ?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 88, "status": 200, "title": "【RNA検出】RNAを基質とするCas13に替わるCas12による直接検出を実現 : crisp_bio", "unwound_url": "https://crisp-bio.blog.jp/archives/40953896.html", "url": "https://t.co/oupzj62fS2"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/jffyOqZ9Bh", "end": 203, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ScienceCrisp/status/2119175810456416679/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119050532681822209", "start": 180, "url": "https://t.co/jffyOqZ9Bh"}]}, "id": "2119175810456416679", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【RNA検出】RNAを基質とするCas13に替わるCas12による直接検出\n(Critical Reviews in Analytical Chemistry誌刊行論文から)\nhttps://t.co/oupzj62fS2\nCas12a (Cpf1), Cas12a2, Cas12a3, Cas12f (Cas14) &amp;Cas12g\n#CRISPR https://t.co/jffyOqZ9Bh", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceCrisp/status/2119175810456416679"}, {"author_id": "818008252814217217", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:12:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119176062018244960"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "RNA detection is essential for molecular diagnostics because it provides dynamic information on gene expression, pathogen activity, and disease progression. Conventional RNA detection methods, part...", "display_url": "doi.org/10.1080/104083…", "end": 173, "expanded_url": "https://doi.org/10.1080/10408347.2026.2747725", "images": [{"height": 1566, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119176110219116544/33Rk6Z9d?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1500}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119176110219116544/33Rk6Z9d?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 150, "status": 200, "title": "Direct RNA Targeting by CRISPR/Cas12: Emerging Mechanisms and Diagnostic Applications", "unwound_url": "https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/10408347.2026.2747725", "url": "https://t.co